<title>POLAND: ZYWIEC JULY NET RISES TO PLN 6.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZYWIEC JULY NET RISES TO PLN 6.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.35 vs   1.21</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	10.26 vs   2.76</p>
<p> Operating profit    11.24 vs   3.26</p>
<p> Sales		   45.80 vs  29.84</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    22.27 vs   4.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	37.19 vs   8.74</p>
