<p> Sales		  229.44 vs 147.32</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish brewer is Zaklady Piwowarskie w</p>
<p>Zywcu SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
